                Your unfair advantage in the Fernie market
              </div>

              <p class="cta-dek">
                I track every listing, price change, and quiet opportunity in Fernie. Share what you want and I’ll send a short, hand-picked list that actually fits.
              </p>

              <ul class="cta-bullets">
                <li><strong>Curated</strong> - a short list, not a feed</li>
                <li><strong>Context</strong> - neighbourhood + Fernie-wide market signal</li>
                <li><strong>Private</strong> - no mass emails or drip campaigns</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <form
              id="hoodForm"
